  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 334035ecee4cd9f4d8be1f6282ba7c23, type: 3}
  m_Name: VerseOne_DialogueData_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Messages:
  - Words must speak truth. Her Grace can see through words of insincerity, illuminating
    dark intentions between sentences.
  - Power hungry individuals nor beggars deserve blessings from the divine. The devotees
    had to acknowledge Her Grace properly.
  - What was acknowledged about Her Grace?
  ButtonOneText: To who blesses the waters that sustain all life...
  ButtonTwoText: To who drives back darkness...
  ButtonThreeText: To who balances light and dark to protect all...
  correctButtonNumber: 2
